    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "\"CLIPPER\" NETS\n7025 - 14050 KC\nPAN AMERICAN\nWORLD'S MOST EXPERTENCED AIRLINE\nRICA\nN\nRADIO WOVC UR 20GN sigs RST. 35q at 21:08 OMT 164p4959\nXMTR Power\n85053299\nRCVR SX :21\nPse QSL\nVESE\nVy/Atan\nStanley F. Earl\nP. O. Box 128\nCoutts, Alberta, Canada",
